D1 - HALT-CLASS FINDING: the graph was not created by this run
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  expected  : AAP 0.1.1 and 0.5.1 - the frontend is invoked by this run over the
              staged input path, writes the graph, and 'a graph already on disk is
              never accepted as this run's output'.
  observed  : the graph at /opt/blitzy-harness/cpg/spark.cpg was written on
